message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Two-Ledger Model: simulation code and synthetic data"
abstract: >-
  Simulation study and synthetic datasets for the Two-Ledger Model, an
  accounting architecture that attributes multi-agent AI cost to individual
  business transactions across clouds, models, and systems of record, and
  reconciles it to provider invoices. Covers the correlation spine (E1),
  period reconciliation (E2), and mid-flight gating (E3).
